Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.90,0:51:35.37,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,買い被った机上之論　倣う
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.00,0:51:38.52,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,You pretend to know the story
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.52,0:51:40.08,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,But you were wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.08,0:51:42.54,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,疑心暗鬼の攻防戦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.54,0:51:45.08,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be fooled again
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.08,0:51:48.92,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,偽善者風情は何奴だ？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.61,0:51:51.00,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Got a killer in me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.00,0:51:52.14,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,I got a skeleton
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.14,0:51:52.74,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Get away
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.74,0:51:54.60,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,I don't need a good Samaritan
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.60,0:51:57.23,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,弛む口元に見透かした
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.23,0:52:00.38,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,漂う幻影が下す采配
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.38,0:52:02.87,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,The walls have ears
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.87,0:52:05.37,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Don't even breathe
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.37,0:52:09.83,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,黙る選択など取らない
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.83,0:52:12.59,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,So get the justice
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.59,0:52:15.33,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Don't you fake it now？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.33,0:52:17.87,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Don't just take a bow
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.87,0:52:22.96,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,うつろう実体の業燃やすサンクチュアリはない
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.96,0:52:25.35,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Don't you fake it now？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.35,0:52:27.88,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Don't just take a bow
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.88,0:52:30.03,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,振り返す痛みごと
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.03,0:52:32.82,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Drink your justice
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.82,0:52:35.99,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Hell, just beat your enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.99,0:52:40.70,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,赦しを乞うように差し出す愚弄のEvidence
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.70,0:52:43.39,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,But this spirit doesn't break
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.39,0:52:45.95,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Just beat your enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.95,0:52:50.67,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,邪推は執拗に蝕んでいくProvidence
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.67,0:52:53.22,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,But this spirit doesn't break
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.22,0:52:58.07,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,醜態も崇拝も
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.07,0:53:02.75,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,曝した刳味はon and on
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.19,0:53:05.71,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Vicious lies
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.71,0:53:08.07,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Fear makes them strong
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.07,0:53:09.86,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,You came here
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.86,0:53:12.91,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,So get the justice
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.91,0:53:15.33,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Don't you fake it now？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.33,0:53:17.87,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Don't just take a bow
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.87,0:53:22.89,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,因果の応報が掻き鳴らすカタストロフィーのネガ
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.89,0:53:25.31,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Don't you fake it now？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.31,0:53:27.87,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Don't just take a bow
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.87,0:53:30.04,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,振り返す痛みごと
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.04,0:53:32.59,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Drink your justice
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.59,0:53:36.01,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,So, just beat your enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.01,0:53:40.68,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,赦しを乞うように差し出す愚弄のEvidence
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.68,0:53:43.44,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,But this spirit doesn't break
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.44,0:53:45.91,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,Just beat your enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.91,0:53:50.69,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,執着は巧妙に蝕んでいくProvidence
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.69,0:53:53.83,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,But this spirit doesn't break
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.90,0:51:35.37,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,以不切实际的纸上谈兵傲视天下
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.00,0:51:38.52,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,你自认为洞悉一切
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.52,0:51:40.08,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,却是大错特错
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.08,0:51:42.54,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,处于满是猜疑的攻防战中
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.54,0:51:45.08,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,我不愿再中计谋
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.08,0:51:48.92,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,是谁披上了伪善的外衣
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.61,0:51:51.00,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,体内深藏着杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.00,0:51:52.14,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,森森白骨发出低沉的轰鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.14,0:51:52.74,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,我要离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.74,0:51:54.60,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,我不需要一个好的撒玛利亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.60,0:51:57.23,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,松懈的嘴角已被看穿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.23,0:52:00.38,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,飘荡的幻影降下指示
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.38,0:52:02.87,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,隔墙有耳
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.87,0:52:05.37,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,屏住所有呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.37,0:52:09.83,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,但不会一直沉默
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.83,0:52:12.59,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,所以 去夺回正义吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.59,0:52:15.33,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,此刻卸下伪装
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.33,0:52:17.87,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,不能只拉下帷幕
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.87,0:52:22.96,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,燃烧转化真正奇迹的圣域已不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.96,0:52:25.35,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,此刻卸下伪装
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.35,0:52:27.88,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,不能只拉下帷幕
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.88,0:52:30.03,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,回顾经历的苦难
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.03,0:52:32.82,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,贯彻你的正义
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.82,0:52:35.99,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,地狱里 击溃你的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.99,0:52:40.70,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,乞求宽恕而交出来的证据是对我的羞辱
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.70,0:52:43.39,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,但是这份意志将永存于世
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.39,0:52:45.95,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,击溃你的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.95,0:52:50.67,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,臆测不断蚕食天命
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.67,0:52:53.22,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,但是这份意志将永存于世
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.22,0:52:58.07,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,丑态与崇拜
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.07,0:53:02.75,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,是彻底暴露的苦涩
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.19,0:53:05.71,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,恶毒的谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.71,0:53:08.07,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,恐惧使其愈发强大
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.07,0:53:09.86,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,而你来到了这里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.86,0:53:12.91,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,所以 去夺回正义吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.91,0:53:15.33,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,此刻卸下伪装
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.33,0:53:17.87,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,不能只拉下帷幕
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.87,0:53:22.89,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,因果报应演奏的悲剧结局
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.89,0:53:25.31,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,此刻卸下伪装
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.31,0:53:27.87,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,不能只拉下帷幕
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.87,0:53:30.04,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,回顾经历的苦难
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.04,0:53:32.59,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,吞下你的正义
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.59,0:53:36.01,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,地狱里 击溃你的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.01,0:53:40.68,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,乞求宽恕而交出来的证据是对我的羞辱
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.68,0:53:43.44,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,但是这份意志将永存于世
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.44,0:53:45.91,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,击溃你的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.91,0:53:50.69,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,臆测不断蚕食天命
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.69,0:53:53.83,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,但是这份意志将永存于世
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.31,0:47:01.31,插曲_Top,,0,0,0,,
